* {{audio|Fr-saler.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|/sa.le/|lang=fr}}, {{X-SAMPA|/sa.le/}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# {{transitive|lang=fr}} to [[salt]]

